    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// Masks account numbers, then builds the Claude request that judges whether\n// the mail asks for a payment. Only the masked text leaves this machine.\nconst stripHtml = h => (h || '')\n  .replace(/<(style|script)[\\s\\S]*?<\\/\\1>/gi, ' ')\n  .replace(/<br\\s*\\/?>|<\\/(p|div|tr|li|h\\d)>/gi, '\\n')\n  .replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ')\n  .replace(/&nbsp;/g, ' ').replace(/&amp;/g, '&')\n  .replace(/[ \\t]+/g, ' ');\nconst body = ($json.text || '').trim() || stripHtml($json.html);\nif (!body.trim()) {\n  throw new Error(`Mail '${$json.subject}' heeft geen tekst om te beoordelen.`);\n}\nconst masked = body\n  // IBAN, with or without spaces\n  .replace(/\\b[A-Z]{2}\\d{2}(?: ?[A-Z0-9]{4}){3,7}(?: ?[A-Z0-9]{1,3})?\\b/g, '[IBAN]')\n  // Long bare digit runs: customer and account numbers. Amounts contain a comma.\n  .replace(/\\b\\d{6,12}\\b/g, '[NUMMER]');\n\nconst schema = {\n  type: 'object',\n  additionalProperties: false,\n  required: ['oordeel', 'samenvatting', 'bedrag', 'uiterste_datum'],\n  properties: {\n    oordeel: { type: 'string', enum: ['geen_actie', 'actie_nodig', 'onduidelijk'] },\n    samenvatting: { type: 'string' },\n    bedrag: { anyOf: [{ type: 'string' }, { type: 'null' }] },\n    uiterste_datum: { anyOf: [{ type: 'string' }, { type: 'null' }] },\n  },\n};\n\nconst system = `You read a Dutch e-mail from Energiewacht, an energy supplier, and decide whether the\ncustomer has to pay something themselves. The mail may be forwarded; judge the forwarded content.\n\noordeel:\n- \"geen_actie\": the mail says the amount is collected automatically, e.g. \"er is gekozen voor\n  automatische incasso\", \"wij schrijven het bedrag af van uw rekening\", \"het bedrag wordt\n  automatisch geincasseerd\". Also when the mail asks for no payment at all (for example a\n  refund or a newsletter).\n- \"actie_nodig\": the customer has to pay or arrange something, e.g. \"u kunt betalen op rekening\n  ...\", \"maak het bedrag over\", \"betaal voor ...\", \"de incasso is mislukt\", \"betaalherinnering\".\n  If the mail mentions automatic collection but also asks the customer to pay, choose this.\n- \"onduidelijk\": you cannot tell from the text. Never guess \"geen_actie\".\n\nsamenvatting: one short Dutch sentence on what the mail says about payment.\nbedrag: the amount to pay or collect, exactly as printed (e.g. \"€ 123,45\"), or null.\nuiterste_datum: the payment or collection date, exactly as printed, or null.`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    claudeRequest: {\n      model: 'claude-opus-5-5',\n      max_tokens: 4000,\n      fallbacks: 'default',\n      output_config: {\n        effort: 'low',\n        format: { type: 'json_schema', schema },\n      },\n      system,\n      messages: [{ role: 'user', content: `Onderwerp: ${$json.subject}\\n\\n${masked}` }],\n    },\n  },\n};\n"
      },
      "id": "a4a58dc6-dafa-595f-8ca6-4ab1e21beb3c",
      "name": "Maskeren en prompt bouwen",
